<title>AUSTRIA: OMV 9-mth net profit flat, pretax up.</title>
<headline>OMV 9-mth net profit flat, pretax up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group net				    1.63   vs    1.63</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    3.60   vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				 55.87   vs   54.01</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				2.24   vs    1.92</p>
<p>    Group earnings before interest, tax  2.21   vs    2.03</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is OMV AG.  </p>
<p>Unit earnings before interest and tax:</p>
<p>    Exploration &amp; production (million ATS)     60   vs     300 loss</p>
<p>    Gas					    1.29   vs    1.28</p>
<p>    Refining (million ATS)			   23   vs     474</p>
<p>    Marketing (million ATS)			 165   vs	60 loss</p>
<p>    Plastics (million ATS)			  517   vs     595</p>
<p>    Chemicals (million ATS)			 441   vs     367</p>
<p>Unit sales:</p>
<p>    Exploration &amp; production		 4.00   vs    3.84</p>
<p>    Gas					    8.26   vs    7.93</p>
<p>    Refining				    29.90   vs   27.44</p>
<p>    Marketing (excl oil tax)		14.25   vs   12.18</p>
<p>    Plastics				     6.81   vs    6.91</p>
<p>    Chemicals				    4.04   vs    6.04</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   4,252   vs   4,321</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast nine-month earnings before interest and tax of 1.9-2.3 billion schillings -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
